                                                "sense_id": "7bc294b3-f0e0-3e1d-9442-eaff8b80584b",
                                                "text": "The body of God, shaped by the Christic paradigm, is also the cosmic Christ—the loving, compassionate God on the side of those who suffer, especially the vulnerable and excluded."
